1
00:00:00,053 --> 00:00:02,383
"If you want a warm butt,
pay for it yourself."

2
00:00:02,589 --> 00:00:05,119
(Raj:)Well, maybe I will, old man.

3
00:00:07,727 --> 00:00:10,717
(Bernadette:)I think that's enough wine for now.

4
00:00:11,931 --> 00:00:14,831
I just keep thinking how cool it would be
if I called my mom...

5
00:00:15,068 --> 00:00:18,628
(Leonard:)...and told her that I got tenure at CalTech.
- She'd be proud, huh?

6
00:00:18,838 --> 00:00:22,068
Oh, very. Assuming she takes my call. Heh.

7
00:00:24,077 --> 00:00:26,547
(Sheldon:)My primary concern
with being granted tenure...

8
00:00:26,746 --> 00:00:29,946
(Sheldon:)...is living with an insanely jealous
roommate after the fact.

9
00:00:30,149 --> 00:00:35,139
(Sheldon:)I might need to sleep with a gun
under my pillow. Or a chainsaw.

10
00:00:35,922 --> 00:00:40,152
(Amy:)Or you take advantage of your newfound
economic stability and move out...

11
00:00:40,360 --> 00:00:45,200
(Amy:)...buy a house, get married, start a family.

12
00:00:46,799 --> 00:00:49,999
(Sheldon:)Or the chainsaw.

13
00:00:52,505 --> 00:00:59,025
(Raj:)And I will return to New Delhi in triumph
atop a bejeweled white elephant.

